OL,3,ASearch continues for boy, 3, missing
OL,4,Afrom playground
OL,5,
OL,6,FSearches are continuing for a missing
OL,7,Fthree-year-old boy who was last seen at
OL,8,Fa playground in a Suffolk village.
OL,10,FNoah Woods was with a relative at the
OL,11,Fsmall park at Merriam Close in
OL,12,FBrantham, but "became separated" from
OL,13,Fthem as they left at about 15:00 BST on
OL,14,FTuesday, Suffolk Police said.
OL,16,FThe toddler, who is partially deaf,
OL,17,Fautistic and non-verbal, was reported
OL,18,Fto have run down a nearby alleyway
OL,19,Ftowards a newbuild housing estate.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
